# U2a: this directory holds shared helpers used by multiple Skills
# (currently the OOXML toolchain reused by docx / xlsx / pptx).
# It is NOT a Skill itself and contains no SKILL.md. The line below
# tells pi-coding-agent's loadSkillsFromDir scanner to skip every
# .md file here, defending against future maintainers who might drop
# a README.md and accidentally have it picked up as a "flat" skill
# (pi treats top-level .md files in a skills root as flat skills).
*.md
